			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule and add dependency repo transfer script\n\nThe Element submodule advances to ec552494 with purely mechanical formatting normalization across Air, Common, Echo, Grove, Mountain, Rest, and Vine — standardizing whitespace, import organization, dev_log! alignment, and lock patterns across 200+ files with no functional changes.\n\nAdd Maintain/Transfer/Dependency/Minor.sh to automate one-shot transfer of 16 dependency repositories (Biome, OXC, Rolldown, SWC, Vercel across Cargo/NPM/Dependency variants plus DocumentationLand) from CodeEditorLand to DependencyCodeEditorLand organization. Script supports dry-run mode, idempotent skip logic, and per-repo retry commands on failure.\n\nFormatting consistency maintained across Element components; new operational tooling for dependency repository governance.",
